Then
\begin{align*} -A \cos(t) - B \sin(t) - 4C \cos(2t) - 4D \sin(2t) - (A \cos(t) + B \sin(t) + C \cos(2t) + D \sin(2t)) &= \cos(2t) \\ -2A \cos(t) - 2B \sin(t) - 5C \cos(2t) - 5D \sin(2t) &= \cos(2t) \end{align*}
Comparing coefficients, we have
\begin{align*} -2A &= 0 \\ -2B &= 0 \\ -5C &= 0 \\ -5D &= 1 \end{align*}
